    "detailed_description": "Play this great new hidden object game from AVI Games. Get and fullfill orders from the detective agency \u201cLost &amp; Found Agency\u201d to search for missing objects and go to fascinating locations full of riddles and mysteries. Explore dangerous places, decipher clues and uncover the secrets leading to the solution. Find the missing objects and solve the crime, confirming your abilities and intuition.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a Collector's Edition filled with exclusive bonuses that you won't find in the standard version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* The Collector's Edition includes: <br />\r\n* 8 additional locations with lots of objects!<br />\r\n* 8 additional minigames! <br />\r\n* And 12 additional minigames for puzzle lovers! <br />\r\n* Downloadable wallpapers! <br />\r\n* The opportunity to listen to soundtracks! <br />\r\n* Add the found objects to your storage!",
